{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2023-02-21 07:30:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ OUTLINES TRANSFORMATION MOMENTUM AND PATH TO LEAD THE FUTURE OF FOOD AT THE 2023 CAGNY CONFERENCE', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ” OR THE “COMPANY”) WILL TODAY DISCUSS PROGRESS THE COMPANY IS MAKING AGAINST ITS STRATEGIC TRANSFORMATION PLAN AND LONG-TERM GROWTH ALGORITHM AT THE 2023 CONSUMER ANALYST GROUP OF NEW YORK (CAGNY) CONFERENCE.'}